Summary: Polymorphing rusted items yields interesting results
Keywords: rust, armor, bug



I was down in Fort Ludios, and I killed zillions of soldiers, leaving their
armor stacked in a pile.  I zapped the pile once with a wand of polymorph
and wandered off; came back to find a lot of the items "very rusted".  Fine,
I polymorphed the pile again anyhow.  Surprisingly, the 'very rusted' flag
seems to have stuck; I got such items as a 'very faded pall' and a 'very
studded leather armor' as well as a very crystal plate mail and of course
various very rusted this'n'that.

This is with the 3.1.0 release for DOS, the "official" release found at
wuarchive (overlaid).

PS Can boots and gloves still get rusted/corroded/damaged?  Rustproofing
   my speed boots didn't make a visible difference.

